 """miner_2 2026-07-30 round-6 novel factor screen.

Tests 8 novel candidates against the full current 12-factor library:
  1) kurt_term_20_60      excess-kurtosis term structure (tail-fatness dynamics)
  2) ovn_gap_mom_20       mean overnight gap return (open/prev_close - 1, 20d)
