## Risk Notes
- **Crowding**: eurusd↔dxy pair (0.81) avoided; down_beta↔vol_of_vol (0.32) and streak↔hilo (0.33) are the remaining highest library correlations — acceptable.
- **Turnover**: vol_adj_mom (turnover rank 3.34), intraday_ret_skew (3.34), vix_beta_cond (3.35) are turnover-heavy; with 10-day horizon and 3bp migration gate, two consecutive rebalances were already cost-gated — turnover discipline is working.
- **Regime-specific**: high-vol exposures (WTI/ETH/SOX) are currently the loss drivers; down_beta/spx_beta tilts remain aggressive but are top-quality validated. vol_of_vol adds to volatile names — kept at ~6% only.
- **Data artifact**: HSI, SX5E, BTC, US10Y, CN10Y are frozen at 2026-07-16 levels in the persistent CSV store; their 0-variance rows were excluded from correlation/dispersion stats. Signals for these names will be stale — the trader should be aware when interpreting their forecast ranks.

